      <h1>Tools made to <span class="font-serif-italic">fit</span> your task.</h1>
      
      <p class="hero-desc-main">Runs in your browser. Your data never leaves your device.</p>
      
      <p class="hero-desc-sub">Small, fast and tools for developers, online sellers, job seekers, exam applicants and more. No uploads. No accounts. No limits.</p>
      
      <div class="hero-actions">
